    "description": {
      "value": "<p>你选择森林作为大地结社的地形。达到表中等级时，获得对应的结社法术。这些法术始终准备，不计入你的每日准备法术上限，对你而言视为德鲁伊法术。</p>\n<table> <thead><tr> <th> <p><strong>德鲁伊等级</strong></p> </th> <th> <p><strong>结社法术</strong></p> </th> </tr> </thead><tbody><tr> <td> <p>3rd</p> </td> <td> <p><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.YbdMfI7wNgrKkpRK]{树肤术}</em><em>barkskin</em><em>，@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.FNDS75JLYFQy4WUq]{蛛行术}</em><em>spider climb</em></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p>5th</p> </td> <td> <p><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.KPqCiGUT62tcmfgY]{召雷术}</em><em>call lightning</em><em>，@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.1TP8dARdcRojx7P1]{植物滋长}</em><em>plant growth</em></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p>7th</p> </td> <td> <p><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.0An7Gb3wSSffcHhV]{预言术}</em><em>divination</em><em>，@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.OZMc9g7XaWuRc36J]{行动自如}</em><em>freedom of movement</em></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p>9th</p> </td> <td> <p><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.tnDSVQwVqkmqWFPP]{问道自然}</em><em>commune with nature</em><em>，@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.UqkkLccwOWYk8aO1]{树跃术}</em><em>tree stride</em></p> </td> </tr> </tbody></table>",
